# Evidence: the strong replay-buffer bridge (BufRelX), 2026-11-22

Date: 2026-11-22.  Toolchain: `leanprover/lean4:v4.35.0`, core libraries only,
lake project `code/tests/lean` (`moreLeanArgs = ["-DwarningAsError=true"]`).
Shell: Windows PowerShell 5.1, `$env:PATH="$env:USERPROFILE/.elan/bin;$env:PATH"`.
Scope: the new module `code/tests/lean/Metronome/Bridge/StreamBuf.lean`
(`namespace Metronome.Bridge.StreamBuf`), which imports
`Metronome.Bridge.Stream` only.  No other module, no `src/`, no `BOTS/` was
edited.  Other agents' concurrent builds in the same checkout are unaffected;
nothing was cleaned.

